The continuity 2024 row equals the registered 2024 result value for value (the builder
checks it): {{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/paired_log_loss/alcaraz_minus_external|s4}}
{{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/paired_log_loss/primary_95_interval|ci4}} on {{ext:comparisons/[id=uts_fixed_formula_adaptation_atp_2024]/cohort/matches|int}} matches.
UTS is not run on 2017–2023: those seasons lie in the formula's weight-tuning window,
predate its code or would need a new timing exclusion (design amendment A2).

